        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Create Creatine Gummies stand out by making one of sports nutrition's most researched supplements easier to consume. Each gummy contains 1.5 grams of Creapure® creatine monohydrate, a premium German-sourced form known for its purity and extensive scientific backing. A standard serving of three gummies provides 4.5 grams of creatine, aligning closely with the commonly recommended daily intake of 3–5 grams for supporting strength, power output, exercise performance, and recovery. The gummies are also vegan, non-GMO, gluten-free, and formulated to resist melting, making them convenient for travel and gym bags. Users frequently praise the sour candy-like taste and portability, particularly those who dislike mixing powders. Some also appreciate the ease of maintaining consistency with supplementation. However, gummies generally cost more per serving than traditional creatine powders and contain added sweeteners that may not suit everyone. Experts also note that effectiveness ultimately depends on achieving an adequate daily creatine intake rather than the delivery format itself. Powders remain the more economical option, especially for long-term use.</p>",
